<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/><view class="page"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><view class="eyebrow">DAILY PLAN · LOCAL MOCK</view><view class="heading">把健康，安排进日常。</view><view class="notice warn section">本地公式模拟，未调用真实AI。用于记录参考，不是医疗或运动处方，不保证减重效果。免费次数、广告奖励与会员次数共用。</view><view class="card section"><view class="title">生成完整周期计划</view><view class="config-row">周期（1–1096天）<input type="number" value="{{days}}" data-key="days" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="config-row">目标减重（斤，0为维持）<input type="digit" value="{{lossJin}}" data-key="lossJin" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="row config-row"><text>活动时段</text><picker mode="time" value="{{start}}" data-key="start" bindchange="input"><text>{{start}}</text></picker><text>至</text><picker mode="time" value="{{end}}" data-key="end" bindchange="input"><text>{{end}}</text></picker></view><view class="config-row">忌口 / 过敏（顿号分隔）<input value="{{restrictions}}" data-key="restrictions" bindinput="input" placeholder="例如：鸡蛋、牛奶"/></view><view class="small-text mt">剩余 {{access.remaining}} 次 · 今日全局可用 {{access.globalRemaining}} 次</view><view wx:if="{{access.requiresCredit}}" class="notice mt">当前会员含广告：使用会员每日额度时还需消耗1次免费或广告永久次数。</view><button class="btn mt" bindtap="generate" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">消耗1次，生成本地模拟计划</button></view><block wx:if="{{plan}}"><view class="section-title section">{{plan.start}} — {{plan.end}}</view><view class="notice mt">{{plan.notice}} {{plan.mode === 'review' ? '当前档案需要专业确认，未执行量化减重目标。' : ''}}</view><scroll-view class="day-nav mt" scroll-x="{{true}}"><button wx:for="{{plan.dates}}" wx:key="*this" size="mini" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="selectDay">{{item}}</button></scroll-view><view class="card section"><view class="title">{{day.date}} · 三餐 {{day.totalKcal}} kcal（模拟估算）</view><view wx:for="{{day.meals}}" wx:key="slot" class="config-row"><view class="pill">{{item.slot === 'breakfast' ? '早餐' : item.slot === 'lunch' ? '午餐' : '晚餐'}}</view><view class="title mt">{{item.title}}</view><view class="small-text mt">{{item.kcal}} kcal · 蛋白质{{item.protein}}g · 碳水{{item.carbohydrate}}g · 脂肪{{item.fat}}g</view><view wx:for="{{item.ingredients}}" wx:for-item="ingredient" wx:key="name" class="small-text mt-sm">{{ingredient.name}} {{ingredient.grams}}g</view><view wx:for="{{item.steps}}" wx:for-item="step" wx:key="*this" class="caption mt-sm">{{step}}</view><view class="actions mt"><button size="mini" data-slot="{{item.slot}}" bindtap="regenerate" disabled="{{busy}}">换一餐（消耗1次）</button><button size="mini" data-slot="{{item.slot}}" bindtap="edit">手动调整</button></view></view><view class="title mt">活动 · {{day.exercise.name}}</view><view class="caption mt">{{day.exercise.time}} · {{day.exercise.minutes}}分钟</view><view class="caption mt">{{day.encouragement}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{editSlot}}" class="card section"><view class="title">手动调整（不扣次）</view><input class="config-row" value="{{editTitle}}" data-key="editTitle" bindinput="input"/><input class="config-row" type="digit" value="{{editKcal}}" data-key="editKcal" bindinput="input"/><button class="btn mt" bindtap="saveMeal">保存调整</button></view><view class="card section"><view class="title">每日任务与本机提醒标记</view><view class="caption mt">提醒仅保存在本机，未接微信订阅通知。</view><view wx:for="{{taskTypes}}" wx:key="id" class="task-row"><view class="row"><text>{{item.label}}</text><switch checked="{{plan.tasks[item.id].enabled}}" data-type="{{item.id}}" data-key="enabled" bindchange="toggleTask"/></view><view class="row mt"><picker mode="time" value="{{plan.tasks[item.id].time}}" data-type="{{item.id}}" bindchange="taskTime"><text>提醒时间 {{plan.tasks[item.id].time}}</text></picker><switch checked="{{plan.tasks[item.id].remind}}" data-type="{{item.id}}" data-key="remind" bindchange="toggleTask"/></view><button size="mini" class="mt" data-type="{{item.id}}" bindtap="task" disabled="{{busy}}">{{item.id === 'photo' ? '去识餐完成今日任务' : '完成今日任务'}}</button></view><view wx:for="{{plan.checks}}" wx:key="createdAt" class="caption mt-sm">{{item.date}} · {{item.type}} 已完成</view></view><button class="btn white section" bindtap="exportPlan">复制完整周期文本，供导出保存</button><button class="btn white mt" bindtap="exportExcel">导出完整周期Excel表格</button></block><view class="card section" wx:if="{{plans.length}}"><view class="title">计划历史</view><button wx:for="{{plans}}" wx:key="id" class="btn white mt" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="history">{{item.start}} · {{item.request.days}}天 {{item.closedOn ? '（已归档）' : '（当前）'}}</button></view></view>